FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tu détestes la chasse aux insectes,
ou quoi ?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Avec si peu d'insectes ici,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
on se sent vraiment très seul...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}A te piace acchiappare insetti?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Hai mai pensato di donarne uno?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Guarda qua che desolazione...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Böcek yakalamaktan nefret mi ediyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Burada bu kadar az böcek olunca{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} biraz
tenha duruyor, sence de öyle değil mi?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}La nostra collezione sta finalmente
prendendo il volo...{{TAG:0007:0001:}} leggera come
una farfalla! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}S'ils nous laissaient utiliser des
filets ici,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ce serait facile d'attraper
des insectes !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

